\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists U\\;\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}(U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists U\\;\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}(U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>枚举所有统一有效开列，对每列作测度截断，再用按索引分配的几何权重合并。源书证明中的截断阈值必须留余量，不能声称所有有效检验的有效索引集合可枚举。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.3.2 Theorem 9.3.5，印刷179，PDF199。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-universal-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"cb407b19d53a051b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-mltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"cb407b19d53a051b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}$ 见 [[43-df-universal-mltest]]，$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists U\\;\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}(U).","display":true}],"bytes":1097,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ml-universal-test]] — 通用 Martin-Löf 检验存在"},{"id":"891bf326beb513ee","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；相关定义见 [[43-df-lowfortest]]、[[43-df-lowforml]]；固定通用相对测试及非相对测试见 [[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]。"},{"id":"6a9e16f7c7ed4975","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mu$ 为下述固定的公平硬币测度，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见